{
  "id": "PRO.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 23",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you sit down to eat with someone important, keep in mind who he is.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "keep",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "notice carefully what is before you.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you have a big appetite, restrain yourself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be greedy for the fine food he serves; he may be trying to trick you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be wise enough not to wear yourself out trying to get rich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your money can be gone in a flash, as if it had grown wings and flown away like an eagle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't eat at the table of a stingy person or be greedy for the fine food he serves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Come on and have some more,” he says, but he doesn't mean it. What he thinks is what he really is. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will vomit up what you have eaten, and all your flattery will be wasted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't try to talk sense to a fool; he can't appreciate it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never move an old boundary mark or take over land owned by orphans. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is their powerful defender, and he will argue their case against you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay attention to your teacher and learn all you can.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't hesitate to discipline children. A good spanking won't kill them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a matter of fact, it may save their lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son, if you become wise, I will be very happy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be proud when I hear you speaking words of wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be envious of sinful people; let reverence for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " be the concern of your life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it is, you have a bright future.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen, my child, be wise and give serious thought to the way you live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't associate with people who drink too much wine or stuff themselves with food. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Drunkards and gluttons will be reduced to poverty. If all you do is eat and sleep, you will soon be wearing rags.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to your father; without him you would not exist. When your mother is old, show her your appreciation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Truth, wisdom, learning, and good sense — these are worth paying for, but too valuable for you to sell.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A righteous man's father has good reason to be happy. You can take pride in a wise son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make your father and mother proud of you; give your mother that happiness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay close attention, son, and let my life be your example. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prostitutes and immoral women are a deadly trap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They wait for you like robbers and cause many men to be unfaithful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Show me someone who drinks too much, who has to try out some new drink, and I will show you someone miserable and sorry for himself, always causing trouble and always complaining. His eyes are bloodshot, and he has bruises that could have been avoided. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.29+PRO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.29",
              "PRO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't let wine tempt you, even though it is rich red, though it sparkles in the cup, and it goes down smoothly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The next morning you will feel as if you had been bitten by a poisonous snake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weird sights will appear before your eyes, and you will not be able to think or speak clearly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will feel as if you were out on the ocean, sea-sick, swinging high up in the rigging of a tossing ship. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I must have been hit,” you will say; “I must have been beaten up, but I don't remember it. Why can't I wake up? I need another drink.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
